herdr compact tree patch for herdr v0.9.3
https://github.com/Malorn44/herdr-patches

Makes the text drawn before each line of a Space entry in the Spaces sidebar
configurable under [ui.sidebar.spaces.tree]. The defaults reproduce herdr's
built-in tree exactly; nothing changes until you set them.

Changed files (Apache-2.0 section 4(b) notice): src/config/sidebar.rs,
src/config.rs, src/client/shell/sidebar.rs, src/client/shell/endpoint_sidebar.rs.

